WEBVTT

00:01:29.502 --> 00:01:31.212
Real magic.

00:01:32.338 --> 00:01:35.383
Now, most people think
that’s kind of crazy,

00:01:35.424 --> 00:01:36.634
three or four years old.

00:01:36.676 --> 00:01:40.304
I don't remember anything
about my childhood for years after that,

00:01:40.346 --> 00:01:42.181
but I remember that day,

00:01:42.181 --> 00:01:44.559
I remember those Sugar Babies,

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:46.477
and I remember that feeling.

00:01:47.728 --> 00:01:52.066
Now, most people think of magic
as a trick, right?

00:01:52.108 --> 00:01:53.234
Abracadabra.

00:01:53.609 --> 00:01:57.655
This seemingly impossible act,
put on purely for entertainment.

00:01:58.447 --> 00:01:59.991
But I'd like to challenge that.